---
import PageHeader from '../../components/PageHeader.astro';
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Bolt Tensioning - Velcorix Services" description="High-precision hydraulic bolt tensioning services in UAE. Velcorix provides accurate load control for critical high-pressure joints in oil, gas, and power sectors.">
<!-- Header (Hero) -->
    <PageHeader 
      title="Bolt Tensioning" 
      subtitle="Accurate Load Control for Large Diameter Fasteners" 
      bgImage="/assets/images/services/DSC_2328.JPG" 
    />

    <!-- Overview (Intro) -->
    <section class="section-padding">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="row">
          <div class="col-lg-6">
            <img
              src="/assets/images/services/DSC_2334.JPG"
              class="img-fluid shadow intro-image"
              alt="Bolt Tensioning Services"
              onerror="this.src='https://placehold.co/800x400?text=Tensioning+Services'"
            />
          </div>
          <div class="col-lg-6 mb-4">
            <h2 class="mb-3">Eliminate Bolt Relaxation</h2>
            <p>
              For critical joints where friction losses from torquing can be a variable, Bolt Tensioning is the preferred method for achieving accurate bolt loads. Velcorix offers hydraulic tensioning services that apply direct axial load to the bolt, stretching it to the required tension without turning the nut.
            </p>
            <p>
              This method eliminates friction, ensuring uniform compression of the gasket and zero torsional stress on the fastener.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

