        <h2 class="cta-heading">Accuracy Matters</h2>
        <p class="cta-subtext">
          Trust Velcorix for precise bolt tensioning services on your critical assets.
        </p>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg mt-3"
